{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_spst_16-03","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"spst_16-03","title":"歸鄉","storyCode":"EG-9","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_spst_16-03.txt","sourceHash":"207d1821062660e173f561d101abe9e664226fc4d4bb32cc230d6df5ea0cf76f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"等炮火止歇、痛呼沉寂，我要回到我母親的身旁，就像出生時那樣。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g13_warshipcommandroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"“各單位注意，這裡是調度中心。”\n“根據聖駿堡緊急電報要求，各單位立即停火。”\n“重複，各單位立即停火。”\n“收到請回覆。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停火範圍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有出戰單位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"narration","text":"“收到。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通知伊爾欽中尉，儘快確認第二師下轄所有兵團是否停火。"},{"type":"narration","text":"“各單位原地待命，保持戰鬥警戒。”\n“在徹底清除威脅之前，我們將繼續踐行拱衛聖駿堡、保護人民的誓言。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……去叫軍需官過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告長官，這次我們沒有軍需官隨軍行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您預期這只是一次快速反應行動——把那些製造暴亂的感染者都消滅不會花費太多的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵，先照常回覆調度中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，你叫什麼名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告長官，我是列兵維亞切·季諾夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，列兵維亞切，去通知中尉吧，這裡暫時不需要你的服務了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……就這麼一件小事，值得讓我擅離職守過來找你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你是瘋了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕季亞，你看你穿著盾衛的制服，多麼威風……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴著那頂頭盔難道真的讓你什麼都看不見了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些軍糧裡的蛆蟲、一折就斷的弩箭——甚至還有啞彈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們就用這種東西出去送死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍糧裡面有蟲，那就吃有蟲的軍糧；武器難以使用，那就用身體去戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是士兵，我們戰鬥，然後勝利。結局只有繼續戰鬥或死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你才是瘋了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發現他人職責上的失誤，你應該報告給上級，而不是在這裡向我抱怨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是軍需官——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得重裝兵團應該在甲板上駐守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉長官，我的確擅離職守了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會將此失職行為上報給督戰官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（敬禮）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵，你發現了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我使你憤怒的緣由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這次行動，我們軍需用品的品質非常低劣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍糧偷工減料，配給的罐頭全都破損，裡面長滿了蛆蟲……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有弩箭……箭頭有不少都不是鋼製的，而是用生鐵濫竽充數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至備用的源石炸彈含有的能量極低，幾乎和啞彈沒有區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣……這樣要我們怎麼進行下一步行動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……士兵，你是為了什麼而從軍的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大聲回答我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為——為了證明自己！我想讓自己的名字被更多人知道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像您一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當軍隊送回你的軍牌，你的母親把你的名字刻在白樺樹上，同樣是一種眾人皆知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是那種……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果集體已經身處一場戰爭，那個人就不會有太多選擇自己結局的餘地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保持這種希望吧，孩子，然後把你的“發現”記在心裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了讓更多的烏薩斯人能夠活下去，為了烏薩斯的存續，事到如今，留給我們的選擇只有一個了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用一把火點燃這片大地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
